# Release signing -- generated locally, never committed. Losing this key
# means every future "update" build gets rejected by Android as a signature
# mismatch, forcing a fresh install (and losing saved login/session data on
# every device it's pushed to) -- back both of these up somewhere safe
# outside the repo.
/keystore/
/keystore.properties

# Packaged source snapshots
*.zip
